{"unit_id":"drscrewdriver__dsh-patch-edit-plus#card-zh","repo":"drscrewdriver/dsh-patch-edit-plus","commit":"9f39d74d24a236b5f2fa664d89401f965487a715","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-patch-edit-plus 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的补丁式文件编辑插件，注册一个 apply_patch 工具，默认接收 git/unified diff，也可开启 Codex apply_patch 语法。它先解析补丁并规划路径，验证所有变更后再统一应用，支持新增、修改、删除和移动文件，并提供 dry run 与变更摘要。适合希望让模型一次处理多处文件改动的开发者；删除和移动需要 DSH shell 能力，Codex 语法默认关闭。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:30-42","src/tool.ts:92-126","src/apply/engine.ts:35-80"]}
{"unit_id":"drscrewdriver__dsh-patch-edit-plus#card-en","repo":"drscrewdriver/dsh-patch-edit-plus","commit":"9f39d74d24a236b5f2fa664d89401f965487a715","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-patch-edit-plus adds a patch-style file editing tool to the DSH Web client. Its apply_patch tool accepts git/unified diffs by default and can optionally accept Codex apply_patch syntax. It parses and plans the patch, verifies all changes before applying them, and supports adding, updating, deleting, and moving files, plus dry runs and change summaries. It suits developers who want an agent to make coordinated edits across files; delete and move operations need a DSH shell capability, and Codex syntax is disabled by default.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:30-42","src/tool.ts:92-126","src/apply/engine.ts:35-80"]}
